      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0222",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "我跑得了。",
      "next": "r0223",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0223",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "殷红",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "你跑得了才怪。又不认路，被逮住了，还怎么找人。",
      "next": "r0224",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0224",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "逮我做什么。",
      "next": "r0225",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0225",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "殷红",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "你在坊市里打了人。酒肆的主人现在还躺在自己的酒里呢。",
      "next": "r0226",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0226",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "你倒替我数着。",
      "next": "r0227",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0227",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "殷红",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "我替你数着，你连谢都不谢一声。",
      "next": "r0230",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0230",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "市令",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "封坊——闲人止步——搜——",
      "next": "r0231",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0231",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "殷红",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "都知的人最懒，追过三条巷就回去交差。",
      "next": "r0232",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0232",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "市令呢。",
      "next": "r0233",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0233",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "殷红",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "市令老爷更懒。他坐着，动嘴皮子。真追上来的，是那些戴青巾的。",
      "next": "r0234",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0234",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "你倒是熟。",
      "next": "r0235",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0235",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "殷红",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "我在这儿唱了三年曲。哪家墙矮，哪条巷是死路，闭着眼也数得出来。",
      "next": "r0236",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0236",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "你不怕。",
      "next": "r0237",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0237",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "殷红",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "怕什么。",
      "next": "r0238",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0238",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "追兵。",
      "next": "r0239",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0239",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "殷红",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "追兵又不是追我。我一个小小唱曲的，闹不出这动静。",
      "next": "r0240",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0240",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "那你为什么跑。",
      "next": "r0241",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0241",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "殷红",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "因为你呆。",
      "next": "r0242",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0242",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "……",
      "next": "r0244",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0244",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "殷红",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "嘘——",
      "next": "r0247",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0247",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "殷红",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "方相面具，师刀，还有那面凉得像浸过水的镜子。你从前不在腰间挂这些东西。",
      "next": "r0248",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0248",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "别问这些。",
      "next": "r0249",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0249",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "殷红",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "哦。连摸都不许摸。",
      "next": "r0251",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0251",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "殷红",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "我叫殷红。在酒肆唱曲，也替人写信、算账。你刚才冲上楼，喊的是什么。",
      "next": "r0252",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0252",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "何素。",
      "next": "r0253",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0253",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "殷红",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "何素……那是我的名字。从前的名字。很久没人喊过了。",
      "next": "r0254",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0254",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "……",
      "next": "r0255",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0255",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "殷红",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "你大老远从人间来，就为喊这两个字。",
      "next": "r0256",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0256",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "来找人。",
      "next": "r0257",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0257",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "殷红",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "找谁。",
      "next": "r0258",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0258",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "找你。",
      "next": "r0260",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0260",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "殷红",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "那首歌。“如日丽天，赫赫大明。”我只记得是我丈夫唱的。他每年都唱，站在火堆前头，举着一杆长戈。你的脸，你的声音，你唱歌的样子，我都记得。只有一样……",
      "next": "r0261",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0261",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "哪一样。",
      "next": "r0262",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0262",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "殷红",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "你的名字。我怎么也想不起来。像被人从脑子里挖走了一块，偏偏挖的是那一块。",
      "next": "r0263",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0263",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "我叫崔皓。",
      "next": "r0264",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0264",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "殷红",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "崔……皓。",
      "next": "r0265",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0265",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "殷红",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "你再说一遍。",
      "next": "r0266",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0266",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "崔皓。",
      "next": "r0268",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0268",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "殷红",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "你的名字，我记不住。这坊里二百六十五户，哪家的名哪家的姓，我闭着眼都背得出来。只有你的……像水，我抓不住。",
      "next": "r0269",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0269",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "不急。",
      "next": "r0270",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0270",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "殷红",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "你不生气。",
      "next": "r0271",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0271",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "我生气做什么。",
      "next": "r0272",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0272",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "殷红",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "你的妻子忘了你的名字，你不生气？",
      "next": "r0273",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0273",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "你没有忘了我。",
      "next": "r0275",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0275",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "你不必跟着我。",
      "next": "r0276",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0276",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "殷红",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "看你呆。哪有人穿着这一身，大摇大摆进坊市的。官署里的人见了这个面具，要么跪，要么拔刀。",
      "next": "r0277",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0277",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "我能应付。。",
      "next": "r0278",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0278",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "殷红",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "我信。可你找不着路。你要去哪儿，我带你。",
      "next": "r0279",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0279",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "轮回堂。",
      "next": "r0280",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0280",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "殷红",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "诶？大半夜去轮回堂……那地方夜里也点灯，你去翻什么。",
      "next": "r0281",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0281",
      "revision": 1,
